Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiftieth Episode\NThe Fortune Teller
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look. What is that over there?\N- It's appearing out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a type of tower\Nthat we've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange construction.\NWhat could it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly imposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it mean?\NIt appeared so suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think it's the work of magic.\N- I think so too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sire!\NWe've discovered what the tower is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an enormous Fortress\Nthat Union X...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...is building\Non the territory of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- A Union X Fortress?!\N- Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- My goodness, Union X!\N- Something terrible is going to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is the\Ncase, I fear it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! X intends\Nto occupy our Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...using the tower!\N- It could be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be terrible! Union\NX is capable of even that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God!\N- Now I would like to know if the tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...has already been completed.\N- No, our observations...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...show that the work\Nis still in progress, Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We must strengthen the defenses before\Nthey complete the construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that tower\Nwill decide the fate of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Union X! I won't give you\Nmy country without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In Silverland\Nthey are preparing defenses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All this fussing\Nwon't do them any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When our tower is\Ncompleted, it will be over for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- How much longer to finish the work?\N- We are doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...as fast as possible,\Nas you can see for yourself, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked when\Nthe work will be completed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so it will take more time\Nthan expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have enough slaves?\NAnd why don't you get more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But boss...\Nthere are no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We are using\Nall the slaves from Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say "slaves from Goldland"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In front of us is Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We will kidnap a hundred\Nof its inhabitants...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we will force them\Nto work for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at them struggling in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how Union X does\Nthings! Go to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Millions of birds\Nare darkening the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that citizens\Nhave disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, Princess!\NA hundred people...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...were enveloped by a\Nswarm of birds and vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see where\Nthose birds came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but it is rumored that they cover...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...an enormous giant\Nclad in iron armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it said that the iron\Ngiant is an evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that birds\Nwill fill Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that we will all be devoured\Nby the evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been drinking! I assure you\Nthat it's all true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who never drinks\Ntold me so!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he saw a giant\Nclad in black armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,crossing the sky\Non a black horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,People, how about\Nhaving your fortunes told?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You ugly old hag,\Nstay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in divination.\NGo away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There are bad omens\Nover your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you will see\Nthe black birds arriving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful and don't\Npanic. It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My omens\Nhave never been wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember my words!\NI am never wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that jinx?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Better go home, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do if that giant\Nactually appears?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And what will you do, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight! I will try to stop\Nhim and save the Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will fight with you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are too small! At this\Nhour you should already be at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw something\Npass under the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm going to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sapphire, what are you doing? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair! Why are you leaving\Nme here? Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm not afraid of just\Nany shadow! Anyway, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened to him?\N- He must be crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! This is the cat\Nthat was with the fortune teller before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize it!\NGo away, you nasty cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a flock of birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The fortune teller was right.\NLet's run, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen!\NI think I hear something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like horse hooves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!\NThe ghost giant is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, so many birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the largest flock\NI have ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, ghost giant?\NCome out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Opale, you stay here and don't move,\NI'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, ghost giant,\Naccept a challenge from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come explain to me why\Nyou kidnap the men of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow you to enter\Nmy country, ghost giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I lose, I will resist\Nwith all my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!\NThe ghost giant has disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, regain consciousness!\NPlease, my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness Opal caught her\Nand brought her back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise she would have died!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried about her..\NWhat did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he doesn't have\Na sure remedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,because he has never seen\Na poison like this in this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sapphire!\NHow I wish I were in her place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,\Nhoping to please you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of bringing you a fortune teller!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see that she will be\Nof some help to Sapphire as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think a fortune\Nteller can do for Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She will be able to see\Ngood or bad omens...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the Princess's destiny!\NCome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all here, good! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How frightening!\NI'm sorry for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle will be surrounded by a\Nthick black mist tomorrow evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You will hear a sound\Ncoming from inside this mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge giant will arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And what will become of Sapphire? Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost giant will kidnap her!\NNo one will be able to prevent it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,because if you resist,\Nthere will be no escape for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, good heavens, it's terrible!\N- You will be annihilated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear? No one must be\Nin the path of the phantom giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cruel fate! She will fall into the\Nhands of the giant while she sleeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way to prevent it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- My Sapphire...\N- Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:15:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We must keep it a secret that\NSapphire is no longer in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret, you say?\NAnd you want no one to notice..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,..that she is no longer in there?\N- Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take Sapphire's place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- But you cannot do that, Your Majesty!\N- I tried to dissuade her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't succeed!\NThat's why I sent for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, if there is no other solution,\NI will challenge the giant! I am ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait! It's better if you go\Nto X's castle, do you understand, Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that the giant is moved\Nby a spirit from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the black mist will disappear\Nif that is destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Queen! I\Nwill tear down that damned castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I will do\Neverything to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For you I would even\Ncross the gates of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me with confidence and\Njust continue your sleep. I will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:15:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you with all my heart\Nto succeed in this endeavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's already night!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Let's run!\N- Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these screams?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost giant the\Nfortune-teller spoke of!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has noticed my presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, crows,\Nrise into the night sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Sapphire, you've recovered!\N- What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? But this...\NThis is mother's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's a reason why you're here!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, where are\Nyou? Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost giant kidnapped her\Njust like the fortune teller said!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- The ghost giant?\N- You shouldn't have gotten up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still too weak!\NYou've been sick, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find the\Nstrength to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- But you're still recovering!\N- Damn X! Give me back my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I told you that you\Nhaven't recovered yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are the mysterious\Nknight and no longer Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Tink! I appeared\Nbecause I have a task to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn X! I will succeed in taking\Nmy mother from your clutches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only two guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help, I can't see anything!\N- Me neither! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, here\Nis what I promised you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done a good job.\NNow we have nothing to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's Sapphire!\N- Damn! What an idiot you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is the Queen of Silverland!\N- Death and damnation! Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This clever one was lying on the bed\Ninstead of her daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- The bells are ringing!\N- Alarm! There are enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop your swords,\Ncitizens of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the prisons, slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,or the Queen will be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw your sword to the ground!\NOr do you not care...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...about what might happen\Nto the Queen of the neighboring country?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is unfair of you\Nto take a hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will count to ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?\NBut that's my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:20:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz, don't worry about me.\N- Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good Prince!\NNow kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so that he may be an example\Nfor the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- The mysterious knight!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take this!\N- Get lost, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Careful, Tink!\N- A little brat like you certainly won't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!\NDamn, you're sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dammit!\N- Franz, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!\NAnd now, it’s our turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I didn't expect that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- For now, it's better to retreat!\N- Wait, X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You royal pain in the ass, you'll\Nvanish along with the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Where did he go?\NI can't see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz, are you alright?\N- Yes, I'm fine, but X has disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Let's get out of here, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.78,0:22:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower is collapsing!\NIt's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone escape, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.22,0:23:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,X forced our people\Nto build the tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...and he used the crows\Nto maneuver the giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to Silverland\Nat a run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon, then!\NWe will follow you shortly. Is that alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Franz, if I see Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give her your regards!\NAnd I'll tell her you'll see each other soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mysterious knight!\NGoodbye and see you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.10,0:23:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you thought\Nyou could defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.74,0:24:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but you won't succeed in doing so!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.82,0:24:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time will be the one\Nand I will destroy Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of that you can be sure!
